#25: Test complete
IF: %FAILED% > 0
GOTO: #Failed:
ELSE: #Passed:

#Failed: A test failed
a. This PCB has failed to pass all Tests
b. Check the Log file for more details on the failed test(s).
IMPORTANT: This PCB has failed to pass all Tests
//DISPLAY: test_failed.png
CLICK_OK:
GOTO: #QUIT:

#Passed: Test's Complete
a. All tests instructions have been completed and a log file created.
b. Click OK to finish and power OFF.
//DISPLAY: AllTestsPassed.png
CLICK_OK:

#QUIT:
COMMAND: TENMAPSU VSET1:0.00
COMMAND: TENMAPSU ISET1:0.00
COMMAND: TENMAPSU VSET2:0.00
COMMAND: TENMAPSU ISET2:0.00
COMMAND: TENMAPSU OUT0
DISCONNECT: TENMAPSU
DISCONNECT: Unknown
SAVE_LOG:
